    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nApartment 5 is a bright ground floor two-bedroom apartment in a small development of just six own door apartments in the heart of Dalkey town. \n\nExceptionally bright and extending to 50 sq.m this ground floor apartment enjoys an open plan living space in the kitchen/living/dining area. There are two bedrooms, a double room and a single bedroom both have fitted wardrobes and a bathroom. \n\nThese superb apartments will appeal to first time buyers and empty nesters alike, so early viewing is highly recommended. \n\nThe location is second to none occupying a prominent position in the Heritage town of Dalkey with a host of excellent coffee shops, bars, pubs, restaurants. Not to mention transport links with DART & Bus routes and of course wonderful outdoor amenities such as Dalkey & Killiney Hills, sea swimming at both Coliemore and Vico Baths."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nwith laminate floors\n\nKitchen/lving/dining - \nnicely appointed with shaker style kitchen incorporates oven, electric hob, fridge freezer and washing/dryer.\n\nBedroom 1 - \nNeat double bedroom with fitted wardrobes overlooking communal grounds\n\nBedroom 2/study - \nsingle room with fitted wardrobes again overlooking communal grounds\n\nBathroom - \npart tiled with large shower cubicle and electric shower, w.c. and wash hand basin and vanity unit. Fitted wall mirror.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Highly convenient and desirable location</li><li> One of six own door apartments</li><li> Communal gardens</li><li> Service Charge 1,989 per annum</li><li> Electric Storage Heating</li><li> Bike & Bin Store</ul>"
      },
      {
